      \field{abstract}{We demonstrate the text-based modeling and redesign of processes in the process execution environment of the Cloud Process Execution Engine (CPEE) based on iterative conversations with an LLM such as gemini or gpt. The input can be text and an empty model as well as text and an existing model. The output is a newly created or redesigned process model in executable format, i.e., based on abstract syntax trees and displayed in BPMN-like fashion, exploiting the automatic layout capabilities of the CPEE. The tool is demonstrated for different scenarios such as the creation and redesign of the process models, as well as the subsequent process model execution.}
